        "description": "About this item TV WALL MOUNT COMPATIBLITY: This Ultra slim TV wall mount fits for most of 37-90 inch LCD/LED/OLED TVs with VESA patterns 100x200 mm up to 600x400 mm and up to 165 lbs. Designed for installation on 12/16\" wood studs, concrete, and brick walls. (Do not install the mount on drywall alone!) Perfect for TV installation in living room, kitchen, bedroom, office or any other place ULTRA SLIM & DISCREET DESIGN: This TV wall mount has been cleverly designed to retract to a mere 2.75 inches from the wall, ensuring a super slim profile that merges flawlessly with your living space. Its design leaves ample room for your creative home décor and with a velcro for cable management, all your cables are neatly organized and hidden, enhancing the neatness and elegance of your space COMFORTABLE VIEWING EXPERIENCE: The monTEK full motion TV wall mount tilts +5°/-15° without tools to reduce glare, extend your TV 16.6″ from the wall and swivel +/-60° for dynamic adjustability to achieve an optimal viewing experience (note that maximum rotation depends on screen size). Level your screen +/-3° after installation to fine tune the TV's position SECURE TV MOUNT: Choose our monTEK TV Wall Mount for reliable TV stability. With 6 tilt and swivel arms, enjoy smooth, optimal viewing angles. Capable of holding up to 165lbs, it's built from heavy-duty steel and features a durable faceplate and secure screws. Having passed a rigorous 4x max load test, this mount combines strong construction and articulating arms for unmatched safety QUICK & EASY INSTALLATION: DTV mount comes with decent instruction, bubble level and necessary hardware in pre-labeled bags for easier installation. Simply attach the TV brackets, mount the wall plate, then hang your TV. Designed for durability, this tv mount offers reliable after-sales service and technical support. Feel free to reach out with any queries › See more product details",
